WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
[Music] Four pets are lost.
This time, they will find their owners themselves.

00:04.000 --> 00:08.000
Maoxianjia: roll the dice, find clues, find your owner.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.000
Roll the dice and explore the town.

00:12.000 --> 00:14.000
Find a clue.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.000
Guess now? A wrong guess costs three turns.

00:16.000 --> 00:22.000
Twenty residents. Which one is your owner?
Each clue narrows the possibilities.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
That's the one! ...Is it?

00:24.000 --> 00:28.000
Other pets are searching too — and can get in your way.
More than sixty item and event types.

00:28.000 --> 00:34.000
A minigame every five rounds.
Fifteen different minigames.

00:34.000 --> 00:36.000
Two islands: Star Island and Riverbend Island.

00:36.000 --> 00:38.000
Invite your friends. Two to four players over LAN.

00:38.000 --> 00:40.000
[Music softens] Is this your person?

00:40.000 --> 00:44.000
Reunited! Collect your yarn-ball rewards.

00:44.000 --> 00:48.000
Maoxianjia. A Unity prototype for Windows.

